This repository is a fork of "propresenter-custom-bibles" by Martijn Lentink
(https://github.com/martijnlentink/propresenter-custom-bibles). The copy this repository was forked from has
no license file. The following belong to the original tool or follow it closely. They are NOT under the MIT
license above; the rights of the original author apply to them, and they stay as they are until he states a
license for them:

  Original files, as they were:
    bible_import.spec, pyinstallercmd, requirements.txt, "Adhoc scripts/",
    Resources/metadata.xml, Resources/available_bibles.json, Resources/example.png,
    tests/reference/bible_import_original.py (an untouched copy used to check the app),
    and the README sections from "How to automatically" onwards.

  Original code, changed or moved into the app:
    bible_import.py (the command-line tool),
    lpbibles/biblecom_html.py and lpbibles/biblecom_pp.py (functions taken from the original tool),
    lpbibles/biblecom.py and lpbibles/export_pp.py (they follow the original tool's way of downloading from
    Bible.com and of installing files for ProPresenter).

Thank you, Martijn, for the original work and for finding out how ProPresenter stores its Bibles.


